            { "text": "対応 VM SKU は v6 / v7 系（Dasv6、Easv6 など）。Azure Linux のみで Arm64 は非対応", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/aks/use-pod-sandboxing", "locator": "前提条件・制限事項", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-19T00:57:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "ホスト ネットワーク アクセス非対応。Defender for Containers は Kata Pod を評価しない", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/aks/use-pod-sandboxing", "locator": "制限事項", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-19T00:57:00Z" }] }
